{"id":"17-821-2-45","zh":"同样：sugato，sugatā；bho sugata、bho sugatā，bhavanto sugatā；sugataṃ，sugate；sugatena，sugatehi、sugatebhi；sugatassa，sugatānaṃ；sugatā、sugatasmā、sugatamhā，sugatehi、sugatebhi；sugatassa，sugatānaṃ；sugate、sugatasmiṃ、sugatamhi，sugatesu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-822-2-11","zh":"同样变化的有：sura（天神）、asura（阿修罗）、nara（人）、uraga（蛇）、nāga（龙）、yakkha（夜叉），","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-823-2-7","zh":"gandhabba（乾达婆）、kinnara（紧那罗）、manussa（人）、pisāca（毕舍遮）、peta（饿鬼）；","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-824-2-7","zh":"mātaṅga（象）、jaṅgama（动物）、turaṅga（马）、varāha（野猪）、sīha（狮子），","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-825-2-11","zh":"byaggha（虎）、accha（熊）、kacchapa（龟）、taraccha（鬣狗）、miga（鹿）、assa（马）、soṇa（狗）。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-826-2-11","zh":"āloka（光明）、loka（世间）、nilaya（住处）、anila（风）、cāga（施舍）、yoga（结合）、vāyāma（精进）、gāma（村庄）、","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-827-2-7","zh":"nigama（市镇）、āgama（传承）、dhamma（法）、kāma（欲）；","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-828-2-11","zh":"saṅgha（僧团）、ogha（暴流）、ghosa（声音）、paṭigha（瞋恚）、āsava（漏）、kodha（忿怒）、lobha（贪），","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-829-2-8","zh":"sārambha（好胜）、thambha（顽固）、mada（骄醉）、māna（慢）、pamāda（放逸）、makkha（覆）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-830-2-11","zh":"punnāga（龙华树）、pūga（槟榔树）、panasa（波罗蜜树）、asana（阿萨那树）、campaka（瞻波迦树）、amba（芒果树），","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-831-2-9","zh":"hintāla（野枣椰）、tāla（多罗树）、bakula（波古罗树）、ajjuna（阿周那树）、kiṃsuka（紧叔迦树）；","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-832-2-7","zh":"mandāra（曼陀罗树）、kunda（茉莉）、pucimanda（苦楝树）、karañja（水黄皮树）、rukkha（树），","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-833-2-7","zh":"还应知道 mayūra（孔雀）、sakuṇa（鸟）、aṇḍaja（卵生者）、koñca（鹤）、haṃsa（天鹅）——","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-834-2-3","zh":"等等，也都如此。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-835-2-6","zh":"但 mana 词群等在 nā、sa、smā、smiṃ 这几个格尾上有特殊变化。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-835-7-9","zh":"其他地方与 purisa 相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-836-2-18","zh":"mano，manā；he mana、he manā，bhavanto manā；manaṃ，mane。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-837-2-9","zh":"承接上文的“vā”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-838-2-7","zh":"95. 在 mana 词群等之后，smiṃ 与 nā 变为 i 与 ā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-839-2-15","zh":"以 mana 开头的词群叫作 mana 词群；在 mana 词群等之后，smiṃ 与 nā 可选地依次替换为 i 音与 ā 音。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-839-16-20","zh":"由“等”字，也包括 bila、pada 等词之后。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-840-2-9","zh":"承接上文的“manogaṇādito”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-841-2-8","zh":"96. 后接元音时，可选地增加 s 音。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-842-2-10","zh":"正是在这些 mana 词群等之后，后面接元音时，可选地增加 s 音。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-842-11-14","zh":"manasā，manena。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-843-2-19","zh":"这个 vā 字表示限定的选择，所以在“mano、manā、manaṃ、mane、manaāyatana”等中不增加。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-843-20-29","zh":"在“mānasikaṃ、cetasikaṃ”等中则一定增加。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-843-30-33","zh":"manehi，manebhi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-844-2-12","zh":"承接上文的“manogaṇādito”与“vā”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-845-2-8","zh":"97. sa 也变为 o。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-846-2-11","zh":"在 mana 词群等之后，后面的 sa 格尾可选地变为 o 音。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-846-12-14","zh":"并增加 s 音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-847-2-25","zh":"manaso、manassa，manānaṃ；manā、manasmā、manamhā，manehi、manebhi；manaso、manassa，manānaṃ；manasi、mane、manasmiṃ、manamhi，manesu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-848-2-6","zh":"同样有 vaco（言语）、vayo（年岁）、tejo（威光）、","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-849-2-6","zh":"tapo（苦行）、ceto（心）、tamo（黑暗）、yaso（名誉）；","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-850-2-6","zh":"ayo（铁）、payo（乳）、siro（头）、chando（韵律）、","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-851-2-6","zh":"saro（湖）、uro（胸）、raho（隐秘处）、aho（日）——","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-852-2-4","zh":"等等，这就是 mana 词群。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-853-2-5","zh":"下面是 guṇavantu 一词的变化。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-853-6-9","zh":"在 guṇavantu 后加 si 时，这里——","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-854-2-12","zh":"“savibhattissa”（连同格尾）与“ntussa”（ntu 的）是统辖项。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-855-2-7","zh":"98. 遇 si 时变为 ā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-856-2-11","zh":"整个 ntu 词缀连同格尾，在 si 格尾时替换为 ā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-856-12-13","zh":"guṇavā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-857-2-18","zh":"以狮子回顾的方式，承接“yomhi”“paṭhame”，并承接“vā”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-858-2-7","zh":"99. ntu 变为 nto。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-859-2-16","zh":"整个 ntu 词缀连同格尾，在第一格的 yo 时可选地替换为 nto，如 guṇavanto tiṭṭhanti（有德者们站着）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-860-2-12","zh":"承接上文的“sunaṃhisu”与“attaṃ”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-861-2-9","zh":"100. ntu 的末音在 yo 等时也变为 a。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-862-2-21","zh":"ntu 词缀的末音 u 在 su、naṃ、hi、yo 这些格尾前变为 a；由“ca”字，在其他的 aṃ、nā、smā、smiṃ、su 前也如此。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-862-22-37","zh":"如 guṇavantā。虽然用第六格就已能成立，替换时却再次用了“anta”一词，由此表明 yo 与 naṃ 有时也变为 i 音。","confidence":60}
{"id":"17-862-38-39","zh":"guṇavanti。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-863-2-9","zh":"承接上文的“aṃ”。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-864-2-8","zh":"101. 遇 ga 时，也变为 a 类元音。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-865-2-13","zh":"整个 ntu 词缀连同格尾，在后接 ga（呼格）时，替换为 aṃ 与 a 类元音。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-866-2-16","zh":"bho guṇavaṃ、bho guṇava、bho guṇavā，bhavanto guṇavanto、guṇavantā；guṇavantaṃ，guṇavante。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-867-2-9","zh":"承接上文的“vā”。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-868-2-7","zh":"102. 遇 sa、smiṃ、nā 时变为 to、ti、tā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-869-2-14","zh":"整个 ntu 词缀连同格尾，在 sa、smiṃ、nā 这些格尾时，可选地依次替换为 to、ti、tā。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-869-15-20","zh":"guṇavatā、guṇavantena，guṇavantehi、guṇavantebhi。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-870-2-8","zh":"103. 遇 sa 时可选地变为 ntassa。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-871-2-13","zh":"整个 ntu 词缀连同格尾，在 sa 格尾时可选地替换为 ntassa。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-871-14-16","zh":"guṇavantassa、guṇavato。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-872-2-8","zh":"104. 遇 naṃ 时可选地变为 taṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-873-2-13","zh":"整个 ntu 词缀连同格尾，在 naṃ 格尾时可选地替换为 taṃ。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-873-14-16","zh":"guṇavataṃ、guṇavantānaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"17-874-2-14","zh":"依“amha tumha ntu”等规则，smā 格尾被当作 nā 处理。","confidence":65}
{"id":"17-875-2-22","zh":"guṇavatā、guṇavantā、guṇavantasmā、guṇavantamhā，guṇavantehi、guṇavantebhi；guṇavantassa、guṇavato，guṇavataṃ、guṇavantānaṃ；guṇavati、guṇavante、guṇavantasmiṃ、guṇavantamhi，guṇavantesu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-876-2-15","zh":"同样变化的有 gaṇavā（有徒众者）、kulavā（出身好的人）、balavā（有力者）、yasavā（有名者）、dhanavā（富有者）、sutavā（多闻者）、bhagavā（世尊）、himavā（雪山）、phalavā（有果实的）、sīlavā（持戒者）、paññavā（有智慧者）等。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-877-2-7","zh":"在 himavantu 一词后加了 si 之后——","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-878-2-14","zh":"在承接“attaṃ”与“ntussa nto”的情况下——","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-879-2-7","zh":"105. 遇 si 时可选地变化。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-880-2-12","zh":"ntu 词缀的末音在 si 格尾时可选地变为 a。","confidence":80}
{"id":"17-880-13-19","zh":"himavanto、himavā，其余相同。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-881-2-13","zh":"再次用“vā”字，是为了禁止 himavantu 一词以外的词变为 a；或者说，这个 vā 字表示限定的选择。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-881-14-17","zh":"因此在 guṇavantu 等词上不会过度适用。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-882-2-31","zh":"同样变化的有 satimā、dhitimā、gatimā、matimā、mutimā、muttimā、jutimā、sirimā、hirimā、thutimā、ratimā、yatimā、sucimā、kalimā、balimā、kasimā、rucimā、buddhimā、cakkhumā、bandhumā、hetumā、setumā、ketumā、rāhumā、bhāṇumā、khāṇumā、vijjumā 等。","confidence":85}
{"id":"17-883-2-9","zh":"其中，satimantu 与 bandhumantu 两词在 aṃ 与 sa 格尾上形式有所不同。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-883-10-20","zh":"承接上文的“attaṃ”与“ntussa”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"17-884-2-8","zh":"106. 遇 aṃ、sa 时，整个可选地变化。","confidence":65}
